SUMMARY: Toronto Country Fest: Amanda & James
DESCRIPTION:Recently nominated for Group or Duo of the Year at the 2025 C
 ountry Music Association of Ontario Awards\, Amanda & James are fast beco
 ming one of the most exciting new acts in Canadian country music. With un
 deniable stage chemistry\, soaring vocals\, and heartfelt storytelling\, 
 this dynamic duo is turning heads with their high-energy original single 
 “Another Round”\, heartfelt ballad “Two Wrongs Don’t Make A Right”\, and 
 a fun country reimagining of the classic “(I’ve Had) The Time of My Life”
 .
