SUMMARY: Toronto Country Fest: Elyse Saunders
DESCRIPTION:Elyse Saunders is an award-winning Canadian country artist kn
 own for her powerhouse vocals\, high-energy live show\, and modern countr
 y sound. The 2024 CMAOntario Female Artist of the Year has earned over 5 
 million global streams and multiple radio hits across Canada and Australi
 a\, including a #6 Australian country radio single. Having shared stages 
 with artists including Brett Young\, Kameron Marlowe\, High Valley\, and 
 Brett Kissel\, Elyse brings heart\, grit\, and undeniable energy to every
  performance.
