SUMMARY: Toronto Country Fest: Rosewood Ave
DESCRIPTION:Multiple CMAOntario nominated duo of the year and CBC Searchl
 ight Outstanding Country artist winner Rosewood Ave is a hot new act mixi
 ng traditional and contemporary sounds. Rosewood Ave is no stranger to th
 e stage\, having opened up for major acts such as Dallas Smith\, Dean Bro
 dy\, The Reklaws\, James Barker Band and Tim & The Glory Boys. Their newe
 st single "Talk About Us" is a high-energy duet that is set to captivate 
 audiences with another chapter in this power couple's love story. With un
 deniable vocal chemistry\, this duo is poised to captivate audiences for 
 years to come.
