SUMMARY: Toronto Country Fest: Sydney Mae
DESCRIPTION:Sydney Mae is an award-winning Americana/Alt Country/Roots re
 cording & performing artist whose voice has the rare power to stop a room
  in its tracks. Currently based in Toronto\, she has been recognized inte
 rnationally for her gift of superior storytelling & silence-commanding pe
 rformance. After making strides in Nashville performing at the iconic Blu
 ebird Café\, headlining Calgary’s ‘Country Thunder’\, opening for Miranda
  Lambert at Big Valley Jamboree\, and many more\, Mae’s next and most pow
 erful chapter is just around the corner with new music brewing.
