SUMMARY: Toronto Country Fest: Tommy Belmont
DESCRIPTION:Known for his authenticity\, Belmont is paving a new lane in 
 Canadian Country music by fusing the grit of old-school hip-hop with the 
 storytelling soul of country. Getting his start in music from a Grandmoth
 er who lovingly capitalized on a young boy being able to carry a tune\, a
 nd a local theatre company offering an alternate route to daycare the fam
 ily couldn’t afford - Tommy found himself as a natural on stage. Belmont 
 has made his Country debut with the 2026 release “Ghost” that marks a cle
 ar evolution toward songwriting that keeps the rhythm\, attitude\, and st
 orytelling that defines Tommy Belmont.
