SUMMARY: Toronto Country Fest: Chris Chamber & Joel Guenther
DESCRIPTION:Kick back with Chris Chambers & Joel Guenther for a high-ener
 gy celebration of Southern country rock and classic Americana. Featuring 
 timeless hits from legendary artists like ZZ Top\, The Marshall Tucker Ba
 nd\, Lynyrd Skynyrd\, Creedence Clearwater Revival\, The Allman Brothers 
 Band\, and more\, this show delivers the soundtrack to long summer nights
 \, backyard barbecues\, and open roads.
