SUMMARY: Toronto Country Fest: Darcy Windover
DESCRIPTION:There is something dazzling - beguiling even - about the musi
 c of Darcy Windover. Standing at the crossroads of Americana\, roots-rock
 \, folk and country\, the Toronto-based singer/songwriter is that rarest 
 of musicians\, one whose songs are at once instantly accessible yet utter
 ly unique. His songs charge along like a freight train\, while the ballad
 s are heartfelt and anthemic.
