SUMMARY: Toronto Country Fest: Propter Hawk
DESCRIPTION:Fronted by vocal powerhouse Malorie Jo Blake\, Propter Hawk i
 s a five-piece Toronto rock group whose cinematic\, road-worn music is as
  fitting for packed dance floors as it is for the closing moments of a lo
 ng night. The band is built from a formidable lineup of veteran musicians
  drawn from northern mining towns and big city boroughs\, grounding their
  sound in life experience\, grit and groove. Now back in their rehearsal 
 studio—known affectionately as the “Loveshack”—Propter Hawk are heading i
 nto their next chapter. With new material on the horizon and a growing re
 putation\, the band stands poised for a future that honours rock and roll
 ’s past while pushing it boldly forward.
