SUMMARY: Toronto Country Fest: Lucas Mason
DESCRIPTION:Lucas Mason is a 19-year-old singer-songwriter from Ontario a
 nd one of Canada’s promising new voices in country and folk. He gained in
 ternational attention in 2024 after joining Zach Bryan on stage in a vira
 l moment captured by millions of views. Since then\, Lucas has performed 
 at major festivals\, including Big Valley Jamboree\, Misty City Music Fes
 tival\, North of Nowhere and Sauble Beach Party\, as well as the Hamilton
  Tiger-Cats Halftime Show and The Horseshoe Tavern. Inspired by Zach Brya
 n\, Tyler Childers and Bob Dylan\, Lucas brings raw honesty to his songwr
 iting. His debut album arrives in November 2026\, with four singles alrea
 dy earning playlist cover features across Apple Music\, Amazon Music and 
 Spotify.
