SUMMARY: Toronto Country Fest: Mike Lynch
DESCRIPTION:Mike Lynch is a Canadiana\, country artist from St. Catharine
 s\, Ontario. His brand of traditional country music is as real\, honest\,
  and authentic as it comes! A singing Canadiana cowboy with a knack for w
 riting a catchy song with a catchy lyric\, that makes you feel something 
 in your heart! An engaging performance topped with masterful guitar work 
 rooted in these country traditions\, and Mike’s own slightly theatrical s
 tyle of on-stage character\, is what brings to mind everything that makes
  great country music so memorable. It also validates Mike Lynch as an ori
 ginal Canadiana artist with his own unique style\, and honest relevant vo
 ice.
