 ntry artist Jade Eagleson’s CCMA-winning band. Multi-instrumentalists Chr
 is Bray and Kevin “The General” Neal put their own distinctive spin on co
 untry classics\, blending in a touch of outlaw grit and southern rock swa
 gger.
