SUMMARY: Toronto Country Fest: DANI
DESCRIPTION:Dani is a Latin country-folk artist whose music is deeply roo
 ted in lived experience. Guided by a razor-sharp pen and a warm\, timeles
 s tone\, her songwriting reads like an open diary. Her debut single\, "Ca
 rolina Gold\," quickly earned industry acclaim\, securing finalist spots 
 at Nashville’s Tin Pan South Songwriters Festival Seminar and the UK’s Co
 ffee Music Project. Drawing inspiration from trailblazers like Linda Rons
 tadt\, Shania Twain\, and Joan Baez\, Dani’s 2025 nomination for Mississa
 uga’s Emerging Talent of the Year cements her status as a rising voice wi
 th transatlantic momentum.
