SUMMARY: Distillery Country Music Series: Stardust
DESCRIPTION:Stardust is a captivating acoustic cover duo born from the cr
 eative talents of seasoned musicians Tim Allard and Chelsea McWilliams\, 
 hailing from the alt-country and Americana band The Redhill Valleys. Know
 n for their soulful melodies and heartfelt performances\, Stardust Duo in
 fuses their signature acoustic and electric stylings and mesmerizing voca
 l harmonies into popular music across genres such as country\, americana\
 , and southern-rock.
